oard cannot perform its core functions.\",\n      \"confidence\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"open_connection\",\n      \"components\": [\"HSE1\", \"FCC1\", \"HSE2\", \"NAVC1\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"FCC1.5\", \"FCC1.37\", \"NAVC1.5\", \"NAVC1.6\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"HSE_IN_FCC\", \"HSE_OUT_FCC\", \"HSE_IN_NAVC\", \"HSE_OUT_NAVC\", \"Net-(NAVC1-PH0)\", \"Net-(NAVC1-PH1)\"],\n      \"observed\": \"FCC crystal nets connect to FCC1 PE6 and PE7 rather than its PH0/PH1 oscillator pins. The NAVC crystal nets have no connection to NAVC1; its PH0 and PH1 pins instead each connect to a separate capacitor to ground.\",\n      \"expected\": \"Each MCU's external crystal should connect between that MCU's HSE oscillator input and output pins, with the associated load capacitors.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"31\\\") (name \\\"HSE_IN_FCC\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC1\\\") (pin \\\"5\\\") (pinfunction \\\"PE6\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"33\\\") (name \\\"HSE_OUT_FCC\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC1\\\") (pin \\\"37\\\") (pinfunction \\\"PE7\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"32\\\") (name \\\"HSE_IN_NAVC\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"HSE2\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"90\\\") (name \\\"Net-(NAVC1-PH0)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"C37\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"spec\",\n          \"quote\": \"HSE crystal (both MCUs) | ABM8G-25.000MHZ-4Y-T3\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"Neither MCU has the specified external crystal connected to its HSE pins; operation may fail or fall back to a different clock, affecting startup and timing.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"bridged_nets\",\n      \"components\": [\"FCC1\", \"UART3_FCC1\", \"C13\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"FCC1.48\", \"FCC1.73\", \"UART3_FCC1.3\", \"UART3_FCC1.4\", \"C13.1\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"UART3_TX_FCC\", \"UART3_RX_FCC\", \"unconnected-(C13-Pad1)\"],\n      \"observed\": \"The UART3 connector's TX and RX nets are connected to FCC1 pins 48 and 73, both identified as VCAP. The netlist also shows C13's first pin unconnected and its second pin on GND.\",\n      \"expected\": \"UART3 signals should use MCU UART-capable signal pins. VCAP pins should have the required capacitor connection, not be used as UART signals.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"144\\\") (name \\\"UART3_RX_FCC\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC1\\\") (pin \\\"73\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VCAP\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"146\\\") (name \\\"UART3_TX_FCC\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"FCC1\\\") (pin \\\"48\\\") (pinfunction \\\"VCAP\\\")\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"source\": \"netlist\",\n          \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"166\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(C13-Pad1)\\\")\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The UART3 connector exposes the MCU's internal VCAP outputs instead of UART signals, which can prevent UART3 communication and may interfere with the MCU's internal regulator.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.99\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The netlist shows critical power and clock connections missing, plus FCC UART3 connector nets assigned to VCAP pins. These deviations contradict the intended powered dual-MCU flight-control design and are sufficient to make the board behave differently from intended.\"\n}",
